 "import": [
  "Import the GLB; each asset root is a Model of MeshParts <Asset>_<Part>. Re-centre with 'origin' (WorldPivot = CFrame.new(origin), then PivotTo); the importer turns every asset 180 degrees about Y (measure and undo it as RealAssets does).",
  "Give every part ONE SurfaceAppearance from its 'surfaceAppearance' block (ColorMap, NormalMap, RoughnessMap; MetalnessMap empty; AlphaMode Overlay; Color white). Parts of one asset share one texture set, so upload each PNG once and reuse the ids.",
  "Per part: CanCollide = collide, CollisionFidelity = collision (edit time, via CreateMeshPartAsync), CastShadow, CanQuery, CanTouch, Anchored, Material = robloxMaterial, Color = rgb, Transparency = transparency (0.15 on the cabin glass), DoubleSided false.",
  "Tags: StyleA_Oak_Bark gets the CollectionService tag Climbable (Perch1-2 attachments on the limbs); StyleA_HunterCabin_Floor / _Porch get Floor. Door attachment = threshold centre, facing out.",
  "Terrain: create one MaterialVariant per 'terrainMaterials' entry (BaseMaterial as suggested, StudsPerTile as given) from the three PNGs."
 ],
